# Miscellaneous Images

Add site-wide images here:

Required:
- `favicon.svg` - Site favicon
- `apple-touch-icon.png` - iOS home screen icon (180x180px)
- `og-image.jpg` - Default Open Graph image (1200x630px)
- `twitter-image.jpg` - Twitter card image (1200x675px)

Optional:
- `logo.svg` - Site logo
- `avatar.jpg` - Personal photo for about section
